&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamführung: &lt;/strong&gt;Du bist Coach, Vorbild und Sparringspartner. Mit echter Empathie führst, inspirierst und entwickelst du dein Team aus 5 Teamleitenden und über 200 Lagermitarbeitenden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schichtleitung: &lt;/strong&gt;Bei dir laufen die Fäden zusammen. Du priorisierst im laufenden Betrieb, löst Engpässe direkt vor Ort und sorgst dafür, dass jede Bestellung pünktlich vom Band rollt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prozessoptimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Stillstand gibt es nicht. Du blickst über den Tellerrand, zerlegst komplexe Logistikprozesse datenbasiert in ihre Einzelteile und hebst unsere Abläufe mit deinen eigenen Projekten aufs nächste Level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Abwechslung: &lt;/strong&gt;Langeweile? Fehlanzeige. Du liebst die Dynamik aus Action direkt auf der Lagerfläche (3-4 Tage pro Woche) und konzeptioneller Deep Dive Arbeit im FC Office (1-2 Tage pro Woche).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholdermanagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Wenn der Betrieb kocht, läufst du zur Hochform auf. Du behältst selbst bei ungeplanten Spitzen einen kühlen Kopf, triffst souverän Entscheidungen und gibst deinem Team jederzeit Rückhalt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein abgeschlossenes Studium (Bachelor oder Master) in Logistik, Supply Chain Management, Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen oder einem vergleichbaren Fachbereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste praktische Einblicke in die Lager-, Logistik- oder Produktionswelt (z. B. durch Praktika oder Werkstudententätigkeiten) und absolute Machermentalität.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein großes Herz für Menschen: Du bist nahbar, kommunizierst sicher auf Deutsch &amp;amp; Englisch und hast Spaß daran, andere über sich hinauswachsen zu lassen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echte Stressresistenz sowie die nötige Flexibilität für unser rotierendes 3-Schicht-System (6:00 – 14:30 Uhr, 14:30 – 23:00 Uhr &amp;amp; 21:30 – 6:00 Uhr, auch samstags).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen scharfen, analytischen Verstand, gepaart mit dem unbedingten Willen, Dinge anzupacken und ins Ziel zu bringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darauf kannst du dich freuen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starte durch - mit uns:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil unseres internationalen Teams in einem Umfeld, das echtes Wachstum und eine „Act like an Owner“-Mentalität fördert. Bei uns hast du die Chance, Projekte eigenverantwortlich voranzutreiben, neue Ideen zu testen und direkt miterleben zu können, wie deine Arbeit in unserem schnell wachsenden Unternehmen Wirkung zeigt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nachhaltigkeit als Kern:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil der Revolution. Du trägst zu einer grüneren Zukunft bei – durch unsere 100 % elektrische Flotte und eine Lieferkette, die Lebensmittelverschwendung reduziert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Basics:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir stellen dir alles für deinen Erfolg bereit – inklusive Laptop und Handy sowie Zugang zu exklusiven Mitarbeiter-Rabatten (Corporate Benefits) für Reisen, Technik und vieles mehr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zeit zum Auftanken:&lt;/strong&gt; Mit 30 Urlaubstagen pro Jahr (bei einer 40-Stunden-Woche) sorgst du für den perfekten Ausgleich zwischen Arbeit und Erholung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verpflegung für Gewinner:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir kümmern uns um dich. Genieße jeden Tag ein frisches, kostenloses Frühstück, Mittag- und Abendessen in unserem Fulfilment Center, dazu gibt es reichlich Snacks und Obst für den Energiekick zwischendurch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unvergessliche Momente:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir sind mehr als nur ein Team. Von unserem legendären jährlichen Ski-Trip über Weihnachtsfeiern bis hin zu Auftritten unserer eigenen Picnic-Band: Wir feiern unsere Erfolge gemeinsam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individuelle Mobilität:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entscheidest, wie du zu uns kommst. Du erhältst einen Firmenwagen (auch zur privaten Nutzung) und kostenlose Parkplätze an den Picnic Standorten stehen dir zur Verfügung. Dazu bieten wir ein „Lease-a-Bike“-Programm an.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lebensmittelretter:&lt;/strong&gt; Hol dir unsere exklusiven &quot;Too-Good-To-Go&quot;-Tüten und rette leckere Lebensmittel – nur für unsere Mitarbeitenden!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lerne &amp;amp; wachse:&lt;/strong&gt; Profitiere von internen Lern- &amp;amp; Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten durch spannende Workshops und intensive Bootcamps, um deine Skills ständig zu erweitern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Absicherung für morgen:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir unterstützen dich mit einem überdurchschnittlichen Zuschuss zur Betrieblichen Altersvorsorge, damit du auch an später denkst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workato is looking for an Engineering Manager to lead the ChatBots and AI team within our Platform organization. This is a high-ownership role for someone who thrives in ambiguity: you turn unclear requirements into clear execution plans, make confident decisions with incomplete information, and keep both the team and leadership aligned. The team is fully remote and international - you&#39;ll build the processes and culture that make it work at pace.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ChatBots and AI team&#39;s mission is to deliver AI agents to end users. We own the runtime and integration layer - conversation storage, API design, streaming, and integrations with external interfaces like Slack and other applications.&amp;nbsp;The team is made up of Senior and Staff engineers working in Ruby/Rails and Go on a modern stack: PostgreSQL, Kafka, Redis, Kubernetes, and AWS.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll collaborate with dedicated QA, SRE, and UX/UI teams, as well as engineering teams across the broader organization. Workato has a strong cross-functional culture - your team won&#39;t work in isolation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Product Managers and stakeholders to scope projects, set timelines, and define what success looks like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan and track execution across quarters and sprints; deliver on schedule without compromising quality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify blockers early, resolve them decisively, and escalate when escalation is the right call&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Balance feature work against internal investments - AI-SDLC, CI/CD, platform upgrades, and technical debt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage, mentor, and grow a team of Senior and Staff engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own hiring, onboarding, and performance management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design team processes that fit a distributed, asynchronous environment - and evolve them as the team and company change&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply AI tooling to how the team works, not just what it builds&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in architecture and design decisions as a technical peer to your engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make trade-off calls on scope, approach, and sequencing - and be accountable for them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand the system deeply enough to allocate the team&#39;s capacity where it matters most&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep leadership informed on progress, risks, and blockers with clarity and without spin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build working relationships with peer leads across engineering and product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent your team&#39;s priorities and constraints in cross-team planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years managing engineering teams, including Senior and Staff-level individual contributors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior engineer-level technical depth - you can read the code, challenge a design, and hold your own in an architecture discussion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on background in backend engineering; experience with Ruby, Go, or comparable languages and distributed systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate under ambiguity: defining direction where none exists, and committing to decisions before all the information is available&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of shipping complex software on schedule in a fast-moving environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing a fully remote, distributed team across multiple time zones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong written communication - in an async environment, writing is the primary management tool&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building AI-powered products - agents, LLM pipelines, or orchestration systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in platform, integration, or developer-facing infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience scaling a team through periods of rapid growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with enterprise SaaS or automation platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2941)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your wellbeing, our mission. Join a company shaping a healthier world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GET TO KNOW US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wellhub we&#39;re revolutionizing workplace wellness. Our platform connects employees worldwide to the best partners for fitness, mindfulness, therapy, nutrition, and sleep—all in one simple subscription. Headquartered in NYC with team members in Europe, North America and South America, we’re on a mission to make every company a wellness company. We believe work should be fulfilling, inspiring, and balanced. Here, you’ll find a team that values wellbeing, collaboration, and different perspectives, where passion and creativity push boundaries to create real impact. Your contributions will help shape a healthier, more balanced world for you and millions of people globally. Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;People Operations Working Student &lt;/strong&gt;for a 6-month contract to our &lt;strong&gt;People Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is to join our People Operations team, dedicated to delivering an exceptional employee experience across Europe. In this role, you will contribute to meaningful People initiatives and gain valuable exposure to key HR topics(e.g. employment law and payroll). You will also gain&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;valuable exposure to&lt;strong&gt; driving efficient operations at scal&lt;/strong&gt;e. You will have the opportunity to learn and apply&lt;strong&gt; analytical problem-solving, a process-oriented mindset, stakeholder management and AI automation &lt;/strong&gt;to elevate our HR systems (e.g., Personio) and workflows… all within a dynamic, international environment. Whilst you will be based in Germany, you will be working on operations across European markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Respond thoughtfully to employee queries, ensuring quick, effective resolutions and an exceptional day-to-day experience for our team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Mindset &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure high accuracy and operational efficiency in core HR processes (e.g. maintaining Personio data, payroll) by following clear procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution-Oriented Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Challenge the status quo by focusing on solutions rather than getting bogged down in problems. Use data and a process mindset to proactively identify ways to optimize workflows and leverage automation to better serve our employees at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live the mission: &lt;/strong&gt;inspire and empower others by genuinely caring for your own wellbeing and your colleagues. Bring wellbeing to the forefront of work, and create a supportive environment where everyone feels comfortable taking care of themselves, taking time off, and finding work-life wellness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in a university, your specific degree subject matter does not matter but an interest in HR, Finance and operations is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are available at least 15h/week (max. 20 hours)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fluent communicator with C1+ level proficiency in both written and spoken German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Berlin-based candidate who can work on-site from our Head Office 2–3 times per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A discreet professional with a proven ability to handle confidential and sensitive information with high integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-driven, adaptable, and collaborative team player with excellent organizational skills and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive learner passionate about employee experience, eager to develop skills in data-driven problem solving, project management, stakeholder management, and operations across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize that individuals approach job applications differently. We strongly encourage all aspiring applicants to go for it, even if they don&#39;t match the job description 100%. We welcome your application and will be delighted to explore if you could be a great fit for our team. For this specific role, please note that &lt;strong&gt;current university enrollment and fluency in German and English (C1+) are mandatory requirements.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With thoughtful benefits, emotional wellbeing resources, and a culture that empowers you to take ownership of your role and your wellbeing, we create an environment where you can thrive in all dimensions of your life. Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WELLHUB:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Free Gold membership with access to onsite gyms and studios, digital fitness programs, and online wellness resources for meditation, nutrition, mental wellbeing support, and more! Add up to three family members to your plan, ensuring access to wellness for those who matter most to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Flexible First company, we offer hybrid and remote options to give you the freedom to work in a way that suits you. The model for this specific role can be discussed with your recruiter and hiring manager. We offer all employees a one-time reimbursement to set up their home office equipment and a monthly work allowance to help cover the costs of working from home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE SCHEDULE: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flexibility for us isn’t just about where we work—it also means being able to shape how and when we get things done. Together with their leaders, employees define schedules that align with their time zones, team needs, and personal routines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PAID TIME OFF:&lt;/strong&gt; We know how important it is to take time away from work to recharge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PARENTAL LEAVE:&lt;/strong&gt; Welcoming a new child is one of the most special moments in your life. Take the time to be present and enjoy your growing family. We offer 100% paid parental leave to all new parents. Parents giving birth are eligible for an extended leave and a ramp-back period to return part-time while they get settled.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAREER GROWTH:&lt;/strong&gt; Access world-class platforms, participate in interactive sessions,&amp;nbsp; build your personalized development roadmap, and explore internal opportunities. We focus on continuous learning and feedback to support your journey toward personal and professional success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CULTURE:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll join a team of passionate people who come together to break boundaries, support each other, and create a meaningful impact in workplace wellness. We win together, building trust through open communication and a culture where every perspective matters. &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/our-values/&quot;&gt;Learn more about our shared culture and values here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to see what it’s really like to work here? Follow us on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatwellhub/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instagram&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; @lifeatwellhub and watch our team video on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZgIPiszTVm4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Belonging at Wellhub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a collaborative, supportive, and inclusive space where everyone knows they belong. At Wellhub, we welcome and celebrate your authentic self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wellhub is committed to creating a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status, or any other basis covered by appropriate law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion also extends to how we recognize and reward our people. We’re proud to be Syndio Fair Pay Certified, reflecting our ongoing dedication to equitable and fair pay practices across our global team. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/posts/wellhub_fairpay-syndio-activity-7407826561531363328-wbN_?utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;amp;rcm=ACoAAAzHQWABKsRqcpvxy4QpDCJNe_szRdC4hgY&quot;&gt;Read more about it here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questions on how we treat your personal data? See our &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/job-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Program Manager in our Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team, you’ll manage the commercial go-to-market for on-top products across our international markets. With a particular focus on new product launches, you’ll build the business case, define the commercial approach and lead cross-functional execution from launch preparation through adoption and scaling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll be the central commercial point of contact for your assigned products, working closely with Product, Product Marketing, local sales leadership, Pricing, Finance and Analytics. You’ll turn analysis into decisions and strategy, align teams around measurable objectives and drive action when performance falls short.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone with a consulting or commercial strategy background who wants to combine analytical depth with hands-on responsibility for product commercialization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own go-to-market plans:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Define target customers, sales motions, market sequencing and launch priorities for on-top products. Drive execution against clear milestones and responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and challenge business cases:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Quantify revenue potential, expected uptake and commercial costs. Test assumptions and make clear recommendations on launch and scaling opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape the commercial proposition:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Work with Product Marketing, Pricing and local markets to translate dealer value into a compelling commercial offer, customer targeting and sales approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive cross-functional launch readiness:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Evaluate commercial preparation, recommend market rollout sequencing and present risks, trade-offs and recommendations to leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage commercial performance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Agree KPIs, targets and reporting requirements before launch. Analyze adoption, usage, sales conversion and revenue contribution to identify what drives or limits growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turn performance insights into improvements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Lead structured performance reviews and coordinate action plans with clear owners and timelines, escalating unresolved dependencies where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strengthen commercialization practices:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Develop reusable business case and performance-management frameworks, capture lessons learned and ensure a clear handover to ongoing owners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in management consulting, commercial strategy, sales strategy and operations, or a similarly analytical business role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience building business cases, financial models and performance analyses, with the ability to test assumptions and explain their business implications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A track record of leading cross-functional initiatives from recommendation through implementation, ideally involving product launches or commercial growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Sound commercial judgment and an understanding of how customer value, pricing and sales execution translate into adoption and revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The ability to structure complex problems, present clear recommendations and influence senior stakeholders without direct reporting authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A pragmatic, collaborative approach, with the drive to resolve obstacles and follow through on results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills in English; German is a big plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
