&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Marketing Manager | Precision Semiconductor Metrology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Abingdon, UK, with up to 30 percent travel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£69,000 - £80,000 (depending on experience)]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A generous annual bonus, death in service and private health care benefits BUPA, EMI Share scheme (UK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a Field Marketing Manager who enjoys connecting advanced technology with the people who need it, why not join us in Abingdon, Oxfordshire, and own the regional go-to-market programmes for advanced semiconductor metrology systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Infinitesima&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Infinitesima is a UK-based pioneer in advanced metrology solutions for the semiconductor industry. Our patented Rapid Probe Microscope (RPM) technology combines the 3D surface detection of atomic force microscopy with high-speed laser actuation and interferometry, delivering sub-nanometre measurements at in-line production throughput. Our Metron3D 300 mm in-line wafer metrology system brings this capability into high-volume manufacturing, addressing process control needs for next-generation devices that optical and electron-beam techniques cannot meet. Metron3D is in use at leading semiconductor manufacturers, and we are growing our team as demand for in-line 3D process control accelerates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and adaptable Field Marketing Manager to own our regional go-to-market programmes for semiconductor metrology. You will connect our technology to fab, R&amp;amp;D and advanced packaging customers, equipment partners and industry audiences through trade shows, technical conferences, customer presentations and targeted marketing collateral. You will work closely with Sales, Product Management, Applications, Engineering and Corporate Marketing to build awareness, generate qualified demand and support revenue growth. This role involves travel of up to 30 percent, in the UK and internationally. If your passion is connecting technology with the people who need it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run field marketing plans aligned with business goals, product roadmaps and regional sales priorities, and own our regional go-to-market programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritise the target accounts (IDMs, foundries, memory makers and OSATs), industry segments, trade shows and regional technical symposia that will do the most for pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and oversee technical and commercial collateral, from product briefs and application notes to measurement and demo data summaries, case studies, white papers and sales enablement materials, in line with our brand and product positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex metrology concepts, such as measurement capability, throughput and process control value, into clear, compelling messages for process engineers, metrology teams and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present to customers, partners and industry audiences at conferences, customer sites and webinars, and back Sales up with account-based marketing and executive briefings for key semiconductor accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Product Management, Applications, Engineering and Corporate Marketing to align messaging, launches and priorities, work with regional sales teams so programmes suit local markets, and share customer, market and competitive insight with Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in engineering, physics, materials science or a related technical field, or in marketing with a strong technical background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[3]+ years’ relevant marketing experience, ideally in field or technical marketing, within a semiconductor or semiconductor equipment company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the semiconductor ecosystem, including metrology and inspection, fab process control, customers, supply chain and trends such as advanced logic, 3D memory and advanced packaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of creating marketing collateral, including technical and product-focused content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and public speaking skills, with experience presenting to customers and industry audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turning complex technical ideas into clear, compelling messages for engineers and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of working well with cross-functional teams, including Sales, Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritising accounts, segments and events to get the most out of pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable travelling up to 30 percent, in the UK and internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid passport and no international travel restrictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to see:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Master’s degree in a technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketing automation and CRM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in international or multi-region marketing, particularly in Asia (Taiwan, Korea, Japan) or Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in the varied perspectives that come from different cultures, experiences, and identities. We believe that true innovation is fuelled by collaboration, locally and globally. We strive to foster an environment where everyone can contribute meaningfully and thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;If you require adjustments to take part in the recruitment process, please let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your recruitment journey:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will interview you: Monday to Friday UK Time 9am to 4.30pm and we&#39;ll be as flexible as we can with Global Scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1st and 2nd stages stage:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote meetings to evaluate your experience and technical ability and meet some of our global senior team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final stage:&lt;/strong&gt; Face to face onsite to meet our senior leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on how we use AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We use AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to transcribe our interviews so we can focus fully on you instead of scribbling notes. The AI does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;take part in any decision making at any stage. All hiring decisions are made by real humans based on the conversation we have with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires a greater&lt;strong&gt; onsite presence along with up to 30 percent global trave&lt;/strong&gt;l due to the nature of the work and business need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruitment agencies: Infinitesima Ltd only works with approved agencies and does not accept unsolicited agency CVs. Please do not submit candidate details in response to this advert or solicit any Infinitesima Ltd employees. Infinitesima Ltd is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited CVs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
