&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;ABOUT BLENHEIM CHALCOT&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a leading digital venture builder, creating and scaling businesses that transform industries through technology, innovation and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ventures operate across a wide range of sectors, including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media and Marketing Technology. Businesses we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance and Modulr.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide our portfolio businesses with the expertise, infrastructure and strategic support needed to scale successfully, spanning technology, commercial growth, talent, finance and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For graduates, this creates a unique opportunity to gain exposure to entrepreneurial thinking, innovative technologies and the practical challenges of building successful businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT FOSPHA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fospha is a fast-growing marketing measurement technology company transforming how global brands understand and optimise their marketing performance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In an increasingly complex digital landscape, Fospha helps businesses understand what is driving growth across their marketing channels, enabling smarter investment decisions and more effective commercial strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Combining advanced data science, AI and marketing analytics, Fospha provides a powerful measurement platform that allows brands to understand the full impact of their advertising investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with leading global brands, Fospha is at the forefront of innovation in marketing technology, helping businesses make data-driven decisions and unlock new opportunities for growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With an international team spanning multiple markets, Fospha offers an exciting environment for ambitious graduates who want to develop their skills, challenge conventional thinking and contribute to a rapidly scaling technology business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fospha.com/&quot; data-rich-text-autolink=&quot;&quot;&gt;https://www.fospha.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment while working directly within Fospha.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be embedded within the Fospha team, contributing to meaningful projects across commercial strategy, business operations, analytics, AI and growth initiatives, depending on business priorities and your strengths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional graduate scheme where you spend months observing. From the outset, you will be encouraged to take ownership, contribute ideas and make a measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated to Fospha&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your day-to-day responsibilities, projects and objectives will be focused on supporting Fospha&#39;s growth and strategic priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Strategic Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Gain experience working on real business challenges, analysing opportunities, improving processes and supporting initiatives that contribute directly to business performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Data &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Develop practical experience of how AI, automation and data-driven decision-making can transform business operations, enhance productivity and create commercial value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Access Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning and development opportunities, designed to strengthen your professional, commercial, analytical and leadership skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Careers Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Benefit from structured development opportunities, mentoring and exposure to experienced professionals across Fospha and the wider BC portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Become part of the wider Blenheim Chalcot graduate community, with access to learning sessions, networking opportunities, collaborative projects and social events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Take responsibility for meaningful projects from an early stage, developing your ability to think independently, solve problems and deliver results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Progression&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Build a strong foundation for a long-term career within a high-growth technology business, with opportunities to develop as the organisation continues to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT YOU COULD BE WORKING ON&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your interests, capabilities and Fospha&#39;s business priorities, you could be involved in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analysing commercial performance, market opportunities and business growth initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting strategic projects that improve operational efficiency and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploring how AI tools and automation can improve existing business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with stakeholders across commercial, product, operations and analytics teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conducting research, preparing business cases and presenting recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifying opportunities to improve how the business operates, makes decisions and delivers value to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting cross-functional initiatives within a fast-growing international technology business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for graduates who are excited by the opportunity to get involved in different challenges, learn quickly and contribute wherever they can make the biggest impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ARE YOU BC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t expect you to have worked in a start-up before, studied a technology-related degree or have extensive professional experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are more interested in your potential, mindset and ability to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from graduates across all academic disciplines, particularly those who demonstrate strong analytical thinking, intellectual curiosity, commercial awareness and an interest in technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people joining the BC Group:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You ask questions, challenge assumptions and are always looking for better ways of doing things. You are genuinely interested in emerging technologies, AI and how businesses grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Commercially Minded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You enjoy solving problems, working with information and understanding how decisions translate into business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You are proactive, resourceful and willing to take initiative. You don&#39;t wait to be told what to do and are motivated by delivering tangible results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You thrive in dynamic environments, adapt quickly to changing priorities and are comfortable navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;
