&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiastic About Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You recognise the opportunities AI, data and digital innovation present and are excited to explore how they can be applied in a commercial environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You are collaborative, approachable and enjoy working with talented people. We value individuals who bring energy to a team and are open to feedback and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
