&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Lead AI &amp;amp; Value Transformation Consultant, you will architect and drive large-scale AI and data-driven business transformation within the Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG) sector using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Senior and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As a master AI operator, your core mandate is to support complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their Finance and Supply-Chain ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Map how the Celonis platform accelerates and underpins the customer’s enterprise AI strategy.. Take end-to-end accountability for massive ROI targets. Craft board-level executive narratives and lead complex, multi-workstream value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute C-level orchestration, cultivating powerful executive sponsorship across the C-suite. Drive lasting adoption by co-owning enterprise-wide change management and building advanced CoE operating models for total self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer and govern massive, cross-regional transformation programs. Implement highly advanced AI-driven account planning across a portfolio of workstreams. Build actionable frameworks that empower the customer to quantify processes at a global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate as a master AI-fluent operator, leveraging advanced copilots for rapid technical outputs and seamlessly orchestrating Applied Value Engineers for complex architectural builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Define the strategic expansion roadmap, positioning Celonis as the underlying intelligence layer for the enterprise. Guide product development by identifying next-generation industry use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
