&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. &lt;br&gt;With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;👐 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will join Alma’s French Mid-Market Sales team, composed of five experienced Sales professionals and one BDR. &lt;br&gt;The team targets accounts across industries, with deal sizes ranging from €30k to €500k in ARR. It has been a clear growth engine for Alma over the last few years, closing between 100 and 200 deals per year and generating several million euros in new revenue annually.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Head of Sales Mid-Market, you will lead complex sales cycles while collaborating with key technology and advisory partners, including PSPs, CMS providers, orchestrators, travel partners and agencies. You will also coordinate with teams across Product, Legal, Finance, Marketing, Account Management, Solution Engineering, Compliance and Risk/Fraud. Your territory will be mainly composed of Travel accounts, representing more than 50% of your scope.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;This position is a permanent role based in Paris.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;💼 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Build and develop a qualified pipeline&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define and execute a focused hunting strategy to identify and engage mid-market accounts with turnovers ranging from €10M to €250M, with a clear focus on the Travel industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Generate and qualify opportunities through outbound prospecting, inbound leads, events, networks, partners and BDR support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Lead complex sales cycles with impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lead multi-stakeholder sales cycles from discovery to closing, typically over three to twelve months, including conversations with C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build compelling, ROI-driven business cases tailored to each account’s commercial reality and coordinate the right internal experts around each opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Turn market insight into action&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Share competitive intelligence, prospect feedback and market signals to strengthen Alma’s positioning and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of the sales playbook and internal processes as the company scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Create reliable visibility and collective performance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Maintain rigorous pipeline hygiene in Salesforce and deliver accurate, reliable forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Actively contribute to team rituals, including weekly pipeline reviews and monthly business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
