&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Salesforce, Gong, Aircall, Dust, Sales Navigator&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
