&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have 3 to 5 years of experience in a similar full-cycle B2B sales role, with a proven track record of closing complex, multi-stakeholder mid-market deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are comfortable engaging with CEOs, Managing Directors, CFOs and other senior decision-makers, and can build credible, ROI-driven business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are curious, well-prepared and able to understand a prospect’s business, challenges and priorities before presenting a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a structured and accountable approach to pipeline management, follow-up and forecasting. Fluency in French and English is required.&lt;/li&gt;
