&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience selling to companies in the Travel industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have previous experience in payments, retail, e-commerce or another complex commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have worked with technology or advisory partners such as PSPs, CMS providers, orchestrators or agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
