&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Interview&lt;/strong&gt; — Deep dive with Wendy Joseph-Konaté on your digital marketing expertise, your approach to AI-driven transformation, and your motivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Values Fit &amp;amp; Team Interviews &lt;/strong&gt;— Meet future colleagues to assess alignment with our 5 core values and team dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
